  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PTc0xpj.png\" alt=\"Elenai Dodge 2 橫幅 - https://i.imgur.com/PTc0xpj.png\" width=\"1280\" height=\"600\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/feathers\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Requires-Feathers-blue?style=flat-square\" height=\"18\" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/810643737238831104?color=blue&amp;label=chat&amp;logo=discord&amp;style=flat-square\" height=\"18\" /></a>&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://files.minecraftforge.net/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/built%20with-forge-red.svg?style=flat-square&amp;logo=conda-forge\" width=\"117\" height=\"20\" /></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-CCA--NC--SA--3-blue?style=flat-square\" width=\"132\" height=\"20\" /></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Elenai Dodge 2 是為 Minecraft 無縫整合的閃避/衝刺機制</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c9ZqQMX.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1280\" height=\"40\" /></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>🧾 功能特色：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💨 深度、平衡良好且無縫整合的閃避系統</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">🎥 可切換的動畫！預設為翻滾閃避，或可停用以獲得原版+的體驗</p>\n<p>🔧 高度可配置</p>\n<p>🦜 與 Feathers 整合意味著閃避需要消耗耐力</p>\n<p>💪 盔甲重量！閃避效果直接受盔甲重量影響。&nbsp;<strong>模組盔甲也會自動擁有重量設定</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fYukRZb.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1280\" height=\"40\" /></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>🎮 控制方式：</strong></span></p>\n<p>在模組設定中選擇&nbsp;<strong>兩種&nbsp;</strong>移動選項！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/n32qEdy.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"80\" />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HyvZJZL.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"80\" /></p>\n<p>你也可以在 Minecraft 的控制選單中調整閃避按鍵，預設值為&nbsp;<strong>左 Alt 鍵&nbsp;</strong>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c9ZqQMX.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"35\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">📺<strong> 動態展示：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">親自體驗這個模組！Youtube 上也有一些很棒的社群創作內容，強烈推薦去看看！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/UTkEcHOi3wefUL4w9P/giphy.gif?cid=790b7611d1ac36bf02e30baca0bb82d20759f0de0d2ecc2f&amp;rid=giphy.gif&amp;ct=g\" width=\"380\" height=\"235\" /><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span><img src=\"https://media0.giphy.com/media/z1avzba8HCxfJ0zOwx/giphy.gif?cid=790b76119f27ce54b2c8eb27d66b875f5b0d1e4d48fc3866&amp;rid=giphy.gif&amp;ct=g\" width=\"380\" height=\"235\" /></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong>🏆 特別感謝：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kosmx/followers\"><strong>KosmX</strong></a></span>&nbsp;創建了 playerAnimation，本模組使用其來處理動畫。</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/Delly_the_puff?s=09\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delly</a>&nbsp;</strong>製作了狀態效果紋理。</p>\n<p><b>感</b>謝<strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/rebirth-of-the-night\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rebirth of the Night 團隊</a>。&nbsp;</strong>該模組包在開發測試過程中被使用，整體來說非常出色。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/therealjackiecrazy\" rel=\"nofollow\">TheRealJackiecrazy</a>&nbsp;為多個模組添加了 Elenai Dodge 2 整合補丁！這真的很棒且很有幫助。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/darkmega92\">Darkmega92</a>&nbsp;在 Discord 上的優秀工作</p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
